#: {{ux|en|'''Ee''' vun iech muss dat dach wëssen!|'''One''' of you must know this!}}
# [[someone]], [[anyone]]
#: {{ux|en|Wann '''een''' no mir freet: ech sinn am Gaart.|If '''someone''' asks for me: I’m in the garden.}}
# [[one]], [[you]] {{gloss|people in general}}
#: {{ux|en|Et muss '''een''' hautdesdaags oppasse, wat '''ee''' seet.|'''You''' must be careful what '''you''' say these days.}}

====Usage notes====
* Becomes {{m|lb|eent}} in the neuter. Otherwise inflects like the numeral.
* In sense 3, it does not usually appear in sentence-initial position. If necessary, {{m|lb|et}} is used as a placeholder (as in the example above).

